# Files / directories excluded from the build context. Smaller context =
# faster builds + smaller image. Also keeps secrets and developer-local
# state out of the image even if .gitignore misses them.

.git
.gitignore

# Python
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.venv/
venv/

# Secrets
.env
.env.local

# User data + credentials — all of data/ is provided at runtime via the
# ./data:/app/data bind mount, so nothing here belongs in the image. Excluding
# the whole dir (not just inbox/archive) keeps todos, contracts, document
# fact-sheets + PDFs, and especially data/credentials/ out of the image.
data/

# Editor / OS junk
.DS_Store
.vscode/
.idea/

# Project-meta docs we don't need at runtime
TODOS.md
README.md
